  m_text: "    <Color=#502813>Common</Color>: Simple help or repelling minor mobs
    (Firefighting, working at a nursing home).\n    <Color=#7C3B1F>UnCommon</Color>:
    Fighting basic mobs (e.g., Collect 10 Slime Bottles).\n    <Color=#B2671C>Rare</Color>:
    Defeating evolved mobs (e.g., Kill a Slime Girl).\n    <Color=#E29A1B>Super Rare</Color>:
    Preventing chaos or destruction (e.g., Kill the Slime Leader or stop terrorist
    groups).\n    <Color=#FFDB00>Legendary</Color>: Nearly impossible tasks with
    extreme risk (e.g., Bring the head of the Ice Dragon from the North Pole).\r\n"
